Hi Builders!🏗️ːtheplanetːːladyengineerːːthebuilderː

Thank you for all your reports on Steam, Discord and through the game. Unfortunately, with the introduction of the new DLC there were a few bugs, it was not possible to catch them all during the testing phase. We are very sorry for this. We hope you will enjoy the game a lot more now. Below are the bugs we have fixed:

- Fixed a stage on the Shelter House map that asked for a completely different action;
- Added information about highlighting grass to be mowed using sense;
- Added a canister to the shop on the Shelter House map;
- Added information in the level name that it is a DLC level;
- Added an additional bucket of cement on the UFO House map;
- Increased the weight of the metal rings on the Shelter House map;
- The game refocuses on the igloo level when the game first starts;
- Fixed a bug related to the wheelbarrow and pouring cement in the UFO level;
- Improved quest descriptions;
- Translations corrected;
- We have added an extra element that makes it easier to enter the UFO ship on the UFO house level.

We encourage you to continue reporting bugs in the gameːiglooː We plan to add another hotfix in the near future if you encounter further bugs. Let's improve House Builder together!ːtheplanetː

Thank you for being and supporting us🦺💝
