Hi Builders!🏗️ 
With today's update, we present to you the bugs we have fixed and the mechanics we have introduced:

- The mechanics of selecting a pad or keyboard + mouse to play House Builder have been made 
easier - now appears 'Press space to leave keyboard input, Press X to leave gamepad input';
- When we have a house pin selected, selecting another house is no longer active;
- Fixed messages on Bamboo House - no longer pops up message to cut down bamboos when you have an axe and not a machete;
- Removed house building material that contributed nothing;
- Fixed a bug with the concrete mixer in the Bungalow level;
- Fixed a bug with the wheelbarrow in the Bungalow level that prevented the player's position from resetting;
- Fixed a bug with a truck that prevented the level from being completed after driving through trash;
- Improved the game's loading mechanics;
- Improved item loading mechanics on all levels.


There are currently fewer houses on the console version than on the Steam version. This is due to the game not being fully configured in terms of the pad this was due to the fact that the port to the console version was handled by another studio, with which we do not collaborate on a daily basis. But I have some good news for you - as you may have noticed, we are improving the pad on the PC version, and we are working on it on the console version as well - and programming is handled by our House Builder programmers from the Steam version! This will allow us to release the same version of the game on consoles as on PC. This will ensure that many players who don't have PCs will have as much fun as Steam players! We'll keep you updated. You are also welcome to visit our Discord🏠:
https://discord.gg/76N77uHWkc

Love you, House Builder Team🦺

